# Old auto-generated tag/category pages were removed (see disableKinds in
# hugo.toml). Cloudflare Pages was serving the homepage for those URLs (a soft
# 404 / duplicate content). Redirect any lingering taxonomy URLs to the blog
# index so Google drops them cleanly and link signal consolidates.
/tags/*        /blog/   301
/tags          /blog/   301
/categories/*  /blog/   301
/categories    /blog/   301
